[
  {
    "content_id": "10022001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;這是所羅門的歌，是歌中最美妙的歌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;深深地吻我吧！ 因為你的愛情比美酒更香甜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你的膏油芬芳怡人， 你的美名馨香四溢， 如同倒出來的香膏， 難怪少女們都愛慕你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你帶我走，讓我們一起奔跑吧！ 王啊，把我帶進你的寢宮吧！ 我們為你歡喜快樂， 我們要頌揚你那勝似美酒的愛情。 難怪少女們都愛慕你！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的少女啊！ 我雖然黑似基達的帳篷， 卻美如所羅門的錦帳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;不要因為我被太陽曬黑就看不起我。 這是因為我的兄弟惱恨我， 要我在烈日之下看守葡萄園， 使我無暇照顧自己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我心愛的人啊，告訴我吧， 你在哪裡牧羊？ 中午帶羊去哪裡歇息？ 我何必在你同伴的羊群旁遊蕩， 像風塵女子一樣呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;絕色佳人啊！ 要是你不知道， 就跟著羊群的足跡， 到牧人的帳篷邊餵養你的山羊羔吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我的愛人啊， 你好比法老戰車上套的牝馬。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;耳環輝映你嫵媚的臉頰， 珠鏈輕襯你美麗的頸項。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我們要為你打造鑲有銀珠的金飾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;王坐席的時候， 我身上的哪噠香膏芬芳四溢。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我的良人在我眼中， 好像我懷中的一袋沒藥。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我的良人在我眼中， 好像隱·基底葡萄園中的鳳仙花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我的愛人啊！ 你真是美極了！美極了！ 你的雙眸好像鴿子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我的良人啊！ 你真英俊！真可愛！ 我們以青草作床榻，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;以香柏樹作屋梁， 以松樹作椽子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我是沙崙平原的玫瑰花， 是谷中的百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我的愛人在眾少女中， 就像荊棘中的一朵百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我的良人在眾男子中， 好像林中的一棵蘋果樹。 我歡歡喜喜地坐在他的樹蔭下， 輕嘗他香甜可口的果子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他帶我走進宴席大廳， 眾人都看見他對我充滿柔情愛意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;請用葡萄乾來補充我的力氣， 用蘋果來提振我的精神， 因為我思愛成病。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他的左手扶著我的頭， 他的右手緊抱著我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的少女啊！ 我指著羚羊和田野的母鹿吩咐你們， 不要叫醒或驚動愛情， 等它自發吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;聽啊！是我良人的聲音， 他攀過高崗，躍過山丘， 終於來了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我的良人好像羚羊和幼鹿。 看啊，他就在牆外， 正從窗戶往裡觀看， 從窗櫺間往裡凝視。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他對我說： 「我的愛人，起來吧！ 我的佳偶，跟我來！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你看！冬天過去了， 雨水止住了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;大地百花盛開， 百鳥爭鳴的季節已經來臨， 田野也傳來斑鳩的叫聲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;無花果快成熟了， 葡萄樹也開滿了花， 散發著陣陣芬芳。 我的愛人，起來吧； 我的佳偶，跟我來。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我的鴿子啊， 你在巖穴中， 在懸崖的隱秘處。 讓我看看你的臉， 聽聽你的聲音吧， 因為你的聲音溫柔， 你的臉龐秀麗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;為我們抓住狐狸， 抓住破壞葡萄園的小狐狸， 因為我們的葡萄樹正在開花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我的良人屬於我，我也屬於他。 他在百合花間牧放羊群。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我的良人啊， 涼風吹起、日影飛逝的時候， 但願你快快回來， 就像比特山的羚羊和小鹿一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我夜晚躺在床上， 思念著我心愛的人； 我尋找他，卻找不到。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我要起來尋遍城裡的街巷和廣場， 我要尋找我心愛的人。 我尋找他，卻尋不到。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我遇上城中巡邏的守衛， 就問：「你們看到我心愛的人了嗎？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我剛離開他們，便找到了我心愛的人。 我拉著他，不讓他走； 我把他帶回娘家， 到懷我者的臥室。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的少女啊！ 我指著羚羊和田野的母鹿吩咐你們， 不要叫醒或驚動愛情， 等它自發吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;那像煙柱一樣從曠野上來， 散發著商人販賣的沒藥、乳香等各樣芬芳之氣的是什麼呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;看啊，是所羅門的轎子， 周圍是六十名勇士， 都是以色列的精兵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;他們個個驍勇善戰，手持利劍， 腰配戰刀，防備夜間的偷襲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;所羅門王用黎巴嫩木為自己造了一頂轎子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;銀轎柱、金靠背、紫錦坐墊， 轎裡裝飾著耶路撒冷少女的愛情。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;錫安的少女啊， 出去看看所羅門王的風采吧！ 他頭上的王冠是他母親在他成婚那天， 在他心中歡樂之日為他戴上的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的愛人啊，你真美麗！真美麗！ 面紗下的雙眸好像鴿子， 你的秀髮就好像躍下基列山岡的山羊群。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你的牙齒如同一群新剪了毛、從水裡洗淨上來的母羊， 成雙成對， 一顆也沒有脫落。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你的唇好像朱紅絲帶， 你的口嬌美， 你面紗後面的雙頰如兩瓣石榴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你的頸項宛若一行行石頭建造的大衛樓塔， 上面裝飾著一千個勇士的盾牌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你的胸好像一對小鹿， 一對在百合花間吃草的孿生小鹿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我要登上沒藥山和乳香岡， 直到晚風吹起、日影消逝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我的愛人啊， 你全然美麗，毫無瑕疵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我的新娘啊， 跟我一起離開黎巴嫩， 跟我一起離開黎巴嫩吧！ 離開亞瑪拿山頂， 離開示尼珥山和黑門山巔， 離開獅穴和豹山吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我的妹妹，我的新娘啊， 你奪去了我的心。 你的秋波一閃， 你項鏈上的明珠， 奪去了我的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我的妹妹，我的新娘啊， 你的愛情多麼迷人， 你的愛情比美酒香甜。 你身上膏油的芬芳遠勝過一切香料。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我的新娘，你的嘴唇滴蜜， 你的舌頭底下藏著奶與蜜。 你衣服散發的香氣， 就像黎巴嫩山一樣芬芳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我的妹妹，我的新娘， 你是緊鎖的園子， 封閉的井，隱藏的泉源。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你好像一個石榴果園， 結滿了上好的果子， 還有鳳仙花和哪噠樹、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;哪噠和番紅花、菖蒲和肉桂， 以及各樣乳香木、沒藥、沉香和一切上好的香料。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你是園中的甘泉，是活水的井， 是從黎巴嫩流下來的溪水。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;北風啊，興起吧！ 南風啊，吹來吧！ 吹向我的園子， 使它的清香四溢。 願我的良人走進自己的園中， 享受其中的珍果。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的妹妹，我的新娘啊， 我已經來到自己的園中， 採了我的沒藥和香料， 品嘗了我的蜂房和蜂蜜， 也享用了我的美酒和鮮奶。 朋友們，盡情吃喝吧。 相愛的人啊，沉醉在愛中吧！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我雖然躺在床上，心卻清醒。 我聽見我的良人叩門，說： 「開門吧！我的妹妹，我的愛人， 我完美無瑕的小鴿子啊， 我的頭上沾滿了露水， 頭髮被夜間的露珠弄濕了。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;可是我已經脫了衣裳，怎能再穿上呢？ 我已經洗了腳，怎能再沾土呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我的良人從門孔伸進手來， 我的心神隨之蕩漾，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;就起來為他開門； 我的雙手滴下沒藥， 門閂也沾了我指頭滴下的沒藥。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我為良人開了門， 他卻已經離開了。 他的離去使我心中失落。 我到處找他，卻找不著； 我呼喚他，卻得不到回答。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;城中巡邏的衛兵遇見我， 把我打傷了， 看守城牆的人還搶走了我的披肩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的少女啊， 我懇求你們， 倘若遇見我的良人， 請告訴他我思愛成病。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;絕色佳人啊！ 你的良人與別的男子比較， 究竟有什麼長處， 以致你這樣懇求我們呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我的良人紅光滿面， 超越萬人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;他頭如純金， 頭髮像波浪， 黑如烏鴉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他的眼睛清澈明亮， 如同溪旁用奶洗淨的白鴿， 如同鑲嵌合適的寶石。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他的雙頰芬芳， 猶如種滿香草的花圃。 他的嘴唇好像滴著沒藥汁的百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他的雙臂如同鑲著水蒼玉的金杖， 身體如同鑲嵌藍寶石的象牙。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他的雙腿好像純金座上的白玉石柱， 他的容貌像黎巴嫩， 佳美如香柏樹。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他的嘴甘甜， 整個人都令人愛慕。 耶路撒冷的少女啊， 這就是我的良人， 我的朋友。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;絕色佳人啊， 你的良人去了何處？ 你的良人轉往何方？ 我們好幫你尋找他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我的良人下到自己的園中， 在香草花圃中牧放他的羊群， 採集百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我屬於我的良人， 我的良人也屬於我。 他在百合花間牧放羊群。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我的愛人啊， 你像得撒一樣秀麗， 像耶路撒冷一樣佳美， 像旌旗飄揚的軍隊一樣威嚴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;求你把視線移開吧， 因為你的眼波使我迷亂。 你的秀髮像從基列山坡下來的山羊群。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你的牙齒如同一群從水裡洗淨上來的母羊， 成雙成對， 一顆也沒有脫落。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你面紗後面的雙頰如兩瓣石榴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;雖有六十個王后， 八十個妃嬪和無數的宮女，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但我完美無瑕的小鴿子獨一無二， 她是她母親的獨女和最愛。 眾女子看見她都誇她有福， 王后和妃嬪見了也連連稱讚她，說：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;「這位燦爛似晨光， 皎潔如月亮，明媚如太陽， 亮麗如佈滿天際之星辰的是誰呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我下到核桃園中， 要看看谷中嫩綠的花木， 看看葡萄樹是否已發芽， 石榴樹是否正在開花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;不知不覺， 我的心把我帶到我尊長的車上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;回來吧，回來吧， 書拉密的少女！ 回來吧，回來吧， 好讓我們再看看你！ 你們為何目不轉睛地看著書拉密的少女， 好像觀看瑪哈念的舞蹈呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的公主啊，你的腳配上鞋多麼美啊！ 你美玉般圓潤的腿是巧匠的傑作。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你的肚臍好像不缺調和酒的圓杯。 你的腰好像被百合花環繞的麥堆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你的胸好像一對小鹿， 一對孿生小鹿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你的脖子宛如象牙塔， 眼睛好像希實本境內巴特·拉並門旁的水池。 你的鼻子好像眺望大馬士革的黎巴嫩塔。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你的頭高昂如迦密山， 你的秀髮好像紫錦， 君王的心被你的縷縷青絲繫住。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我的愛人，你是多麼美麗， 多麼討人喜愛，令人陶醉啊！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你亭亭玉立如同棕樹， 你的胸就像樹上的果串。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我要攀上這棕樹， 握住樹上的果子。 願你的胸像葡萄串， 你的氣息如蘋果般清香。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你的親吻像上好的美酒。 願美酒流入我良人的口中， 緩緩注入他陶醉的唇齒間。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我屬於我的良人， 是他所戀慕的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我的良人，來吧！ 讓我們到田間去， 在村莊裡住宿吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我們清晨去葡萄園， 看看葡萄樹是否已經發芽開花， 石榴樹是否正在開花。 我要在那裡把我的愛情獻給你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;那裡風茄飄香， 門口有各樣上好的新陳美果。 我的良人，這都是我為你存留的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;如果你是我的同胞兄弟就好了。 這樣，在外頭遇見你， 我也可以親吻你， 沒有人會取笑我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我可以把你帶進教養我的母親家。 我要給你喝石榴汁釀的醇酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他的左手扶著我的頭， 他的右手緊抱著我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的少女啊， 我吩咐你們， 不要叫醒或驚動愛情， 等它自發吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;那從曠野上來、靠在良人身旁的是誰呢？ 我在蘋果樹下喚醒你， 你母親在那裡懷你養你， 為你受生產之苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;請把我印在你的心上， 刻在你的手臂上， 因為愛情如死亡一般堅固， 嫉妒像陰間一樣殘酷， 它燃起的火焰是燒滅一切的烈火。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;愛情，大水不能熄滅， 江河不能淹沒。 若有人想傾其家財買愛情， 必遭唾棄。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我們有一個小妹， 她的胸還沒有發育。 若有人來提親， 我們該怎麼辦？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;她若是牆， 我們要在上面建造銀塔； 她若是門， 我們要用香柏木板圍護她。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我是一面牆， 我的雙乳像城樓， 我在他眼中像找到平安的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;所羅門在巴力·哈們有一個葡萄園， 他把葡萄園租給看守的人， 租金是每人一千塊銀子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我的葡萄園，我自己作主。 所羅門啊，你的一千塊銀子自己留著， 二百塊銀子給管果園的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你這住在園中的人啊， 同伴們都在聆聽你的聲音， 求你讓我也聽見吧！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我的良人啊， 願你像香草山上的羚羊和小鹿， 快快來到我身邊！</p>"
  }
]